  "description": "This walk climbs into the hills above Glencar Lough in County Leitrim. The route follows the Dooneens Walk Trail which you can find on the northern side of the lake. You can follow the grassy trail north to climb to the viewpoints where there are wonderful views back down to the lake.To continue your walking you could pick up the popularGlencar Waterfall Walk.",
